  **IRepositoryLoader API:**
  • load_repository()
  • load_json()
  • get_custom_source()
  • get_custom_source_array()
  • get_custom_mkdeps()
  • get_custom_extras()
  • get_custom_is_group()
  • get_custom_no_package()
  • parse_depends_to_solvable()
  • generate_repodata()
  • update_repository_metadata()
  • add_package_tar_bz2()
  • internalize_repo()
end note

note right of IDepResolver
  **IDependencyResolver API:**
  • create_solver()
  • solve_dependencies()
  • add_mkdeps_to_queue()
  • display_problem_proof()
end note

note right of IPkgDownloader
  **IPackageDownloader API:**
  • download_package()
  • download_extras()
  • download_package_to_directory()
  • get_cache_dir()
end note

note right of IPkgBuilder
  **IPackageBuilder API:**
  • commit_element()
  • find_source_path()
  • apply_extras()
  • set_staging_enabled()
  • set_staging_dir()
  • set_build_tmp_dir()
  • run_with_chroot()
